{"reviewId": "3215729_87PWWB2kn", "review": {"abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "虽然作者没有把房价放在康波里分析，但是作者关于商品标的的表述，房价是非常契合的，既有使用属性又有金融属性，而且还带有政策属性", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "4712-4780", "createTime": 1774322961, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "3215729_87PWWB2kn", "userVid": 3215729, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 418609871, "name": "周榆悦（📖遥远的救世主", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0015-xwh1M0n00iHO8OiAk~~MSfa/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "周榆悦（📖遥远的救世主", "isV": 1, "vDesc": "逻辑学｜经济学｜历史｜军事｜政治｜哲学", "roleTags": ["优质荐书达人"], "followPromote": "Ta已帮助28038位书友找到心仪书籍", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-5000", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "书海指明灯", "levelIndex"